  "locationGatheringInfoTitle": "Gathering Info",
  "locationGatheringInfoContent": "Rank Categories:\n• Low Rank: Includes all Guild 1★ to Guild 5★ quests, and Village 1★ to Village 6★ quests.\n• High Rank: Includes all Guild 6★ to Guild 8★ quests, and Village 7★ to Village 9★ quests.\n• G Rank: Includes all Guild G1★ to Guild G3★ quests.\n• Treasure: Includes all Treasure Hunt quests.\n• Training: Includes all Training School quests.\n\nNote: Since Beginner and Low Rank share the exact same gathering data, Low Rank represents both categories in this section.\n\nGathering Node Types:\n• Gather: Action of collecting items from the environment, such as plants, bones, etc.\n• Mining: Action of using a Pickaxe to mine ores and stones.\n• Bugnet: Action of using a Bug Net to catch insects.\n• Fishing: Action of using Fishing Baits to catch fish.\n\nValues and Probabilities:\n• The numbers after the action type indicate the minimum and maximum gathering attempts available at that node (∞ means unlimited gathers).\n• Percentages (%) show the exact chance of obtaining each item per attempt.\n\nAdditional Note:\nCertain quests may use customized gathering, especially account item delivery quests (e.g., Mountain Herbs, Special Mushrooms, Coal, etc.).",
